     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ng-hiv-eac-adherence-vs</b></p><a name=\"ng-hiv-eac-adherence-vs\"> </a><a name=\"hcng-hiv-eac-adherence-vs\"> </a><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-eac-form-cs.html\"><code>https://fhir-ig.digitalhealth.gov.ng/CodeSystem/ng-hiv-eac-form-cs</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version ?0.0.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-eac-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-eac-form-cs-adherence-good\">adherence-good</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Good</td><td>The client demonstrates good adherence to the prescribed ART regimen.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-eac-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-eac-form-cs-adherence-fair\">adherence-fair</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Fair</td><td>The client demonstrates fair adherence to the prescribed ART regimen.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-eac-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-eac-form-cs-adherence-poor\">adherence-poor</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Poor</td><td>The client demonstrates poor adherence to the prescribed ART regimen.</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
